const body="Glad you received it. Here's how we work:\n\nWe usually agree a flat rate per job. Before you accept, you get the full scope: complete inventory, pickup and destination, access details, floors/stairs, distance and any special requirements. You review it and we agree the payout upfront. Any scope changes come back to us for approval.\n\nPayment is by direct deposit to your bank account on or before 7 days after job completion.\n\nYou carry your own insurance and add MARS RELOCATION SERVICES INC as additional insured. If there's damage, report it to us immediately. We handle customer communication; the claims process and responsibilities need to be confirmed in the written agreement before the first job.\n\nYour crew works under the Saturn Star Movers name. The customer relationship stays with us, and all complaints, inquiries and scope changes must come through us rather than being handled directly with the customer.\n\nIf that works for you, please complete the form and upload your documents so we can review your team.\n\nJohn, SSM";
